{"track":"python","category":"기초 문법","level":2,"title":"구구단 한 줄","desc":"<p><code>n</code>단의 1~9배 값을 리스트로 돌려주는 <code>times_table(n)</code>을 만드세요. 예: <code>times_table(2)</code> → <code>[2, 4, 6, ..., 18]</code></p>","starter":"def times_table(n):\n    pass\n","solution":"def times_table(n):\n    return [n * i for i in range(1, 10)]\n","hint":"<p><code>range(1, 10)</code> 은 1부터 9까지예요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"times_table(3)","expected":[3,6,9,12,15,18,21,24,27],"visible":true},{"call":"times_table(1)","expected":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9],"visible":true},{"call":"times_table(9)","expected":[9,18,27,36,45,54,63,72,81],"visible":false},{"call":"times_table(0)","expected":[0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0],"visible":false}],"id":"py-033"}